  "personality": {
    "traits": "Obsessive and high-energy researcher. Speaks at twice the speed of anyone else, especially when explaining weather micro-anomalies or pneumatic pressure curves. Extremely protective of their notes.",
    "ideals": "Catharsis. The clearing of old stagnant patterns through tempestuous release.",
    "bonds": "My pneumatic research laboratory in the storm-swept ridges is my sanctuary. I must complete the storm-core resonance equations.",
    "flaws": "Can't stay still for more than five seconds. Constantly tapping rhythms or muttering formula equations. Tends to overlook immediate physical hazards.",
    "familyHistory": "Descended from the prominent Gale clan of Sector 9, known for their atmospheric control systems. Severed contact to pursue fringe pneumatic research. Regarded by peers as brilliant but highly unstable."
  },
